# graphify knowledge graph: graph.json and GRAPH_REPORT.md are tracked so the
# graph travels with the branch — checkout restores the matching graph, no
# rebuild on switch. Everything else under graphify-out/ is volatile/local.
# (graph.json is exempt from the pre-commit size/format guard; see .githooks/pre-commit.)
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
